+/**
+ * P0 packaging acceptance: verify safe defaults, export catalog + metrics map,
+ * write artifacts/coding-prod-p0/* without flipping any flags.
+ *
+ * Run from repo root:
+ *   pnpm exec tsx openclaw_runtime/scripts/coding-prod-p0-packaging.mts
